     0 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
     1 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.001 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.005 seconds
group fq type 1 2
192 atoms in group fq
pair_style hybrid/overlay lj/cut 10.0 coul/long 10.0 coul/shield/intra ${rsh} all
pair_style hybrid/overlay lj/cut 10.0 coul/long 10.0 coul/shield/intra 5.0 all
pair_coeff 1 1 lj/cut 0.01275 3.144
pair_coeff 1 2 lj/cut 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff 2 2 lj/cut 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff * * coul/long
pair_coeff * * coul/shield/intra 1.11
kspace_style pppm/samqeq ${kacc}
kspace_style pppm/samqeq 1.0e-6
neighbor 2.0 bin
fix chg fq qeq/sam 1 0.0 10.0 ${tol} spcfq_expt.param
fix chg fq qeq/sam 1 0.0 10.0 1.0e-7 spcfq_expt.param
fix_modify chg recip_probes 16
samqeq: recip_self calibration = deterministic multi-probe (K lowest global tags)
fix_modify chg solver cg nofallback
samqeq: lr solver = CG (symmetric, indefinite-safe)
fix_modify chg energy yes
timestep ${dt}
timestep 0.001
fix integ all rigid/nve/small molecule
Fix rigid/nve/small setup ...
  create bodies CPU = 0.000 seconds
  64 rigid bodies with 192 atoms
  1.0000026 = max distance from body owner to body atom
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe etotal f_chg
run ${nrun}
run 200000

